# The keys the model-comparison harness and scripts/endToEndSanityCheck.ts read. Not a file to render:
# `task secrets:evals -- <cmd>` injects these from the overview-evals project into the one command, and
# nothing is written. Each is that project's own key, so eval spend bills apart from dev and prod
# (docs/conventions/secrets.md, "Projects are the environment boundary").
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY
OPENAI_API_KEY
GEMINI_API_KEY
